        "outcome_metric_name": "Reduction in signs and symptoms of osteoarthritis Change from baseline in the western Ontario and McMaster Universities (WOMAC) 3.1 osteoarthritis Index composite, pain, Morning stiffness and physical function subscale scores (TimePoints: Visit 1: Day -7 (Screening) Visit 2: Day 1 (Baseline) Visit 3: Day 30 (Data Collection) Visit 4: Day 60 (Data Collection) Visit 5 Day 90 (Data Collection))",
        "outcome_metric_value": "Kellgren and Lawrence scoring/ assessment of osteoarthritis (TimePoints: Visit 1: Day -7 (Screening) Visit 2: Day 1 (Baseline) Visit 5 Day 90 (Data Collection))"
